    └── pep8 was renamed to pycodestyle in 2016; both provide the same noqa() function for inline ignore 
        comments. flake8 and ruff are modern linters that also understand # noqa comments and can serve as
        drop-in replacements for the linting role. The code only uses pep8.noqa() to check for noqa 
        comments, which all candidates support.

